  "title": "MVB Bank is scaling its Fintech business without scaling its back office",
  "summary": "MVB, a subsidiary of MVB Financial Corp. (Nasdaq: MVBF), has selected Bretton AI to deliver AI-native Managed Services for its back-office operations. A dedicated US-based Bretton AI team will run Anti-Money Laundering transaction monitoring and Know Your Customer work, delivered as completed alerts and cases, in line with MVB's policies and risk framework.",
